<!--
  Declarative metadata only - the things you change in the org, not in the editor.
  Use with:  sf project retrieve start -x manifest/org-changes.xml

  Deliberately excludes ApexClass, ApexTrigger, ApexPage, ApexComponent,
  LightningComponentBundle, AuraDefinitionBundle and StaticResource: that source
  lives in git and travels local -> org only. Retrieving it is what strips the
  trailing newline Prettier puts back, which is the deploy/retrieve churn.

  Also excludes DigitalExperience* - the org regenerates that JSON with its own
  ordering, so it churns on every round trip. Add it back only when you have
  actually edited the site in Experience Builder.
-->
